00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:08,060
Now, I've talked about this in a recent AI news video, and since then, I've dug into it even more.

105
00:10:08,078 --> 00:10:13,260
Basically, dots are these always-on AI agents that you can assign ongoing responsibilities.

106
00:10:13,260 --> 00:10:18,000
To, and they keep on working on them even when you're not using ChatGPT anymore.

107
00:10:18,140 --> 00:10:24,420
So for example, I've been using my dot to help me with my YouTube analytics and updating them automatically every time I post.

108
00:10:24,622 --> 00:10:32,400
I connected it to my YouTube channel and it pulls views and engagement data to find patterns across my titles and topics and angles and post times.

