00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:02,080
If you want to check out some of those examples.

146
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:15,800
Now, personally, I think this engine plus like AI paint job or AI reskin is a pretty realistic path to AI games, at least more so than like asking a model to do everything.

